,{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq99cd9g09skslldniw7u2ub","title":"腾讯混元 AI Infra 新开源：HPC-Ops 推理核心算子全面升级","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-06-12T00:00:34.422Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmq99cd9g09skslldniw7u2ub","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/y0vd1cpvWXLSssL1kXxguw"],"articles":[{"id":"cmq99cd9g09skslldniw7u2ub","title":"腾讯混元 AI Infra 新开源：HPC-Ops 推理核心算子全面升级","originalTitle":"","summary":"腾讯混元 AI Infra 团队开源升级 HPC-Ops 推理算子库，推出五大核心算子。Attention 采用运行时动态负载调度，长文本最高加速 2.95x，端到端 QPM 提升 17%；Router GEMM 以双 BF16 组合实现 FP32 精度，对比 CuBLAS FP32 最高提速 3.22x；FusedMoE 相对 vLLM、SGLang 性能提升 1.2x～1.6x；Fused AllReduce+Norm 对比主流方案最高提速 1.68x；Sampler 将解码采样融合为 2 个 CUDA Kernel，相对 vLLM 提速 4.0x～7.5x。所有能力均来自生产实践并完全开源。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq99cd9g09skslldniw7u2ub","originalUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/y0vd1cpvWXLSssL1kXxguw","publishedAt":"2026-06-12T00:00:34.422Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1uy8xe2","originalSourceName":"公众号：腾讯混元","family":"tencent","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"产品发布/更新","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq99cd9g09skslldniw7u2ub","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-08T12:49:07.382Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1uy8xe2","name":"公众号：腾讯混元","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-08T12:49:07.382Z"}],"sectionLabel":"产品发布/更新","reportSummary":"腾讯混元 AI Infra 团队开源升级 HPC-Ops 推理算子库，推出五大核心算子。Attention 采用运行时动态负载调度，长文本最高加速 2.95x，端到端 QPM 提升 17%；Router GEMM 以双 BF16 组合实现 FP32 精度，对比 CuBLAS FP32 最高提速 3.22x；FusedMoE 相对 v