银行、航空公司、保险公司及政府机构运营的关键系统。内部部署中，Claude已成为DXC OASIS平台的默认基础模型，该平台超95%代码由Claude编写，开发速度提升10倍，已服务50多家客户。DXC加入Claude Partner Network，将在保险、现代化服务、网络安全及应用服务四个领域率先推出基于Claude的解决方案。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq9tg1bi0f3qslld86ne1vt3","originalUrl":"https://www.anthropic.com/news/dxc-anthropic-alliance","publishedAt":"2026-06-12T00:00:34.422Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-15gzes8","originalSourceName":"Anthropic：Newsroom（网页）","family":"anthropic","kind":"official","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq9tg1bi0f3qslld86ne1vt3","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-08T12:49:07.382Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-15gzes8","name":"Anthropic：Newsroom（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-08T12:49:07.382Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"Anthropic与IT服务公司DXC Technology达成多年全球联盟。DXC将培训数万名获得Claude认证的前沿部署工程师（FDE），将Claude引入其为全球大型银行、航空公司、保险公司及政府机构运营的关键系统。内部部署中，Claude已成为DXC OASIS平台的默认基础模型，该平台超95%代码由Claude编写，开发速度提升10倍，已服务50多家客户。DXC加入Claude Partner Network，将在保险、现代化服务、网络安全及应用服务四个领域率先推出基于Claude的解决方案。","reportEdition":"2026-06-12","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmq9ljue40czuslldeag7dg21","title":"Runway与Lionsgate扩大战略合作","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-06-12T00:00:34.422Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmq9ljue40czuslldeag7dg21","https://runwayml.com/news/runway-and-lionsgate-expand-partnership"],"articles":[{"id":"cmq9ljue40czuslldeag7dg21","title":"Runway与Lionsgate扩大战略合作","orig